			"notes": "Updated to 1.21\n\nAdded some EMI Compatiblity.\nAdded Molten Metals (made by putting ingots or blocks into the bloomery).\nAdded Casting (done by using a cast on the bloomery, providing that the bloomery has sufficient metal).\nAdded Anvil for crafting.\nAdded Heat Component (items must be a specific heat for anvil recipes to work).\nChanged Forge to heat items instead of crafting (no visual feedback yet, you just have to take the item out and see).\nAdded Heat States (data files primarily used for melting metals in the bloomery)."
