			"notes": "Adds equivalents of Vanilla tools that can be crafted from a combination of components.\n\nNo recipe viewers are supported (with the exception of minimal EMI support) so here are the recipes:\n\nPutting a metal ingot in the forge gives you the corresponding pickaxe head.\nPutting a log in the forge gives you the corresponding tool handle.\nPutting string and slime in the forge gives you the corresponding tool binding.\nPutting a tool handle in the forge gives you the corresponding sword grip.\nPutting a pickaxe head in the forge allows you to make the next metal tool component in the order below (ex. putting a pickaxe head gives you an axe head, axe head gives you a shovel head, all the way until you get a sword guard).\nPickaxe Head -> Axe Head -> Shovel Head -> Hoe Head -> Sword Blade -> Sword Guard\n\nPutting a tool handle, tool binding, and tool head in the workbench in that specific order gives you the corresponding tool.\nPutting a sword grip, sword guard, and sword blade in the workbench in that specific order gives you a sword."
		}
